uffer. A value of 512 produces a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"buffer as wide as the tile itself. Larger values produce fewer rendering"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"artifacts near tile edges and slower performance. The default value is 128."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"MLNShapeSourceOptionBuffer","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesourceoptionbuffer","role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSourceOptionBuffer"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNComputedShapeSource/initWithIdentifier:options:":{"fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initWithIdentifier:options:","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a custom shape data source initialized with an identifier, and a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dictionary of options for the source according to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specification"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"initWithIdentifier:options:","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlncomputedshapesource\/initwithidentifier:options:","role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNComputedShapeSource\/initWithIdentifier:options:"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNComputedShapeSourceDataSource":{"title":"MLNComputedShapeSourceDataSource","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNComputedShapeSourceDataSource","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlncomputedshapesourcedatasource","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Data source for "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNComputedShapeSource","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". This protocol defines two optional methods for fe